  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "52c5c94a6253b6d1",
      "translationZh": "发布 Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v4.3",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9450edeb3b17ecf9",
      "translationZh": "我们正在将 Terminal-Bench 升级至 4.0，并加入 AutomationBench-AA，这是一项采用私有测试集的智能体工作流自动化基准测试。这是我们逐步推出 Intelligence Index v5 的延续。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "f559ffeae4f0223b",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 智能指数",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "484caeebf995e9ca",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v4.3.2 纳入了 10 项评测：AA-Briefcase v1.1、GDPval-AA v2.1、AutomationBench-AA、Terminal-Bench 4.0、SciCode、Humanity's Last Exam、GDP.pdf、CritPt、AA-Omniscience、AA-LCR v1.1",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e678f6a0cf7f45d0",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis Intelligence Index v4.3.2 包括：AA-Briefcase v1.1、GDPval-AA v2.1、AutomationBench-AA、Terminal-Bench 4.0、SciCode、Humanity's Last Exam、GDP.pdf、CritPt、AA-Omniscience、AA-LCR v1.1。更多详情请参阅 Intelligence Index 方法论，其中包括各项评测的详细介绍，以及我们如何运行这些评测。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "e8d75ed958db3347",
      "translationZh": "Claude Fable 5.1 和 GPT-6 Astra 在 Intelligence Index 中领先：Claude Fable 5.1（max，带回退机制）和 GPT-6 Astra（max）在 Intelligence Index v4.3 上均获得 53 分，其后依次是 Claude Opus 5（max，51）、Claude Fable 5（带回退机制，50）、Muse Spark 1.3（max，48）和 GPT-5.6 Sol（max，47）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "1e3c7845f3bc82bf",
      "translationZh": "GLM-5.3 和 Kimi K3 继续领跑开放权重模型：GLM-5.3 Flash（42）是实力第三强的开放权重模型，其后是 Qwen3.8 2.4T A95B（40）和 DeepSeek V4 Pro 0813（max，36）。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "list-item",
      "sourceHash": "74d48d249f78b0a8",
      "translationZh": "4 家实验室占据智能水平与单任务成本的帕累托前沿：OpenAI 占据了成本效率前沿的大部分位置，近期发布的 GPT-6 Astra 的全部五档推理强度，都在各自对应的智能水平下提供了最低的单任务成本。MiMo-V2.5-Pro（26）、GLM-5.3-Flash（42）和 Claude Fable 5.1（xhigh、max，53）占据了前沿的其余位置。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "d2e5b6c377ed1b45",
      "translationZh": "Terminal-Bench：从 2.1 升级至 4.0",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a38d8cc738cd6478",
      "translationZh": "完成向最新版 Terminal-Bench 的升级。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "61f36a1df2c11fd5",
      "translationZh": "以 AutomationBench-AA 替换 𝜏³-Banking",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "46c780194fa616fa",
      "translationZh": "我们对 Zapier 业务工作流自动化基准的实现。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "097a0d89c7d74a85",
      "translationZh": "我们继续优先致力于让 Intelligence Index 尽可能实用，为此提前推出了原计划用于 Index v5 的部分变更。v4.2 和 v4.3 中的每项变更都有其独立价值，让该指数更贴近现实世界的问题解决，增加更多私有测试集以防止针对评测投机取巧，并降低饱和程度。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9791141e136fc959",
      "translationZh": "Intelligence Index v4.3 提高了智能体编程任务的难度，并拓宽了所测试的智能体工作流类型。由于我们与 Zapier 合作为 AutomationBench 使用了留出测试集，包含私有任务或答案的评测所占权重从 40% 增加至 45%。各类别权重与 v4.2 相比保持不变：智能体 30%、编程 20%、通用 30%、科学推理 20%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "5ffd41c5dd848e4e",
      "translationZh": "阅读完整的方法论变更日志",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "02df9c72fa426ba1",
      "translationZh": "我们正从 Terminal-Bench 2.1 升级至 4.0，后者包含更具难度的终端任务。Terminal-Bench 4.0 测试智能体能否通过终端完成复杂工作，涵盖软件、机器学习、科学、运维、安全、硬件和媒体等领域。此次更新重新校准了计算资源和时间限额，并改进了任务说明、环境和验证机制。我们将全部 66 项任务各运行三次，并报告平均 pass@1。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7beddf9f16e67866",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6 Astra (max) 的得分为 59.1%，相比之下，Claude Fable 5.1 (max with fallback) 为 52.0%，Claude Opus 5 (max) 为 49.0%。Astra 比得分为 39.9% 的 GPT-5.6 Sol (max) 高出 19.2 个百分点。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2b6c704f9545c57d",
      "translationZh": "Terminal-Bench 4.0：得分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "78327adc0f2e3deb",
      "translationZh": "由 Artificial Analysis 独立进行基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6c03721c7fb7a2f4",
      "translationZh": "我们正在用 AutomationBench-AA 替代 𝜏³-Banking，前者涵盖了更广泛的跨应用业务工作流。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cdffa3339a0d6e0f",
      "translationZh": "我们与 Zapier 合作，使用该基准的 v1.0.6 版本运行包含 657 项任务的留出测试集。我们将自己的实现称为 AutomationBench-AA，因为我们会对已完成的目标给予部分分数，而任何违反护栏规则的行为都会使该任务的得分降为零。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0671558c79ed849",
      "translationZh": "其 657 项任务涵盖财务、人力资源、市场营销、运营、销售和支持。智能体在模拟的业务应用中开展工作，并发现相关 API 以完成各项任务。对于每项任务，我们衡量已完成目标的占比。任何违反护栏规则的行为都会使该任务得零分。“得分”是全部 657 个工作流中这些任务得分的平均值，也是智能指数所使用的指标。“已完成任务”则单独报告在未违反护栏规则的情况下完成所有目标的工作流占比。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b78b14e462586f4e",
      "translationZh": "GPT-6 Astra (max) 的得分为 68.5%，相比之下，Grok 4.6 (high) 为 66.7%，GLM-5.3 (max) 为 62.2%。Astra (max) 在 41.6% 的工作流中完成了所有目标且未违反护栏规则，相比之下，Claude Fable 5.1 (max with fallback) 的这一比例为 32.1%，Claude Opus 5 (max) 为 28.3%。在遵守所有护栏规则的同时完成所有目标，仍然比完成工作流的一部分更难。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "cff0e5a115d25435",
      "translationZh": "AutomationBench-AA：得分",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "edbb11750ab086d9",
      "translationZh": "在未违反任何防护规则的情况下完成的任务目标占比 · 越高越好 · 基准由 Zapier 开发 · 由 Artificial Analysis 独立开展基准测试",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d768254fdc7ad2e",
      "translationZh": "AutomationBench-AA 报告两项指标。得分是模型完成的任务目标占比，其中任何违反防护规则的任务均计为零分。已完成任务是完整完成的任务占比，要求达成每个目标且未违反任何防护规则。两项指标均为越高越好。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "af9642e2c08e44da",
      "translationZh": "相近的智能指数得分可能对应截然不同的成本。GPT-6 Astra (max) 和 Claude Fable 5.1 (max with fallback) 的得分均为 53，但它们每项智能指数任务的平均成本分别为 3.26 和 7.63——Astra 的成本低 57%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bb70804ea1605ce2",
      "translationZh": "GLM-5.3-Flash 和 GPT-5.6 Terra (max) 的智能指数得分均为 42，但 GLM-5.3-Flash 每项任务的成本仅为后者的 18%（0.25 对比 1.40）。在更低的价位上，GPT-5.6 Luna (max) 的得分为 38，每项任务的成本为 0.18。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "2f47a4890795d11d",
      "translationZh": "智能指数与每项智能指数任务的成本",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d8b8e2f5128754cf",
      "translationZh": "Artificial Analysis 智能指数 · 每项 Artificial Analysis 智能指数任务的加权平均成本（USD）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e4cd651be70da16f",
      "translationZh": "最具吸引力的象限",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f0143297cb46c9bf",
      "translationZh": "每项智能指数任务的加权平均成本。每项评估的成本根据输入、缓存命中、缓存写入、推理和回答的 token 价格计算，除以任务数量，再按该评估在智能指数中的权重加权。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "829a076374e551a7",
      "translationZh": "完整结果与方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "32ec2ab76ec396dc",
      "translationZh": "总体得分体现了不同的优势。Claude Fable 5.1 在 AA-Briefcase 和 SciCode 上得分更高，而 GPT-6 Astra 在 Terminal-Bench 4.0 和 AutomationBench-AA Score 上得分更高。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c6143077bb070561",
      "translationZh": "各类别在智能指数中的权重保持不变：智能体：30%，编程：20%，通用能力：30%，科学推理：20%。Terminal-Bench 4.0 保持与 Terminal-Bench 2.1 相同的权重，AutomationBench-AA 则取代 𝜏³-Banking，沿用其 5% 的权重。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "de4a438eb7d0b4e5",
      "translationZh": "问题或答案不公开的评测占智能指数 v4.3 权重的 45%，高于 v4.2 中的 40%。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b2c769a47d009aac",
      "translationZh": "查看完整结果 阅读评测方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c2dd6438201440ff",
      "translationZh": "智能指数 v4.3——评测、私有测试集与权重 类别 评测 私有测试集 权重 智能体 30 %",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
